 (BasicWaves)"]],["p-ae4033c98c13f32a.html","source-block-390","Source",["Morph (BasicWaves)"]],["p-ae4033c98c13f32a.html","source-block-403","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/01 BasicWaves",["Morph (BasicWaves)","Source"]],["p-4475c9dd4939dcde.html","source-block-123","Sub (BasicWaves)",[]],["p-4475c9dd4939dcde.html","source-block-144","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BasicWaves.",["Sub (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4475c9dd4939dcde.html","source-block-279","Adds a sine-wave sub-oscillator.",["Sub (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4475c9dd4939dcde.html","source-block-315","Source",["Sub (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4475c9dd4939dcde.html","source-block-328","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/01 BasicWaves",["Sub (BasicWaves)","Source"]],["p-4467e4dd492dcd63.html","source-block-123","Sym (BasicWaves)",[]],["p-4467e4dd492dcd63.html","source-block-144","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BasicWaves.",["Sym (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4467e4dd492dcd63.html","source-block-280","Morphs between square-wave pulse width and phasing between the two sawtooth copies. It has no effect when Wave is at 50 (sawtooth).",["Sym (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4467e4dd492dcd63.html","source-block-415","Source",["Sym (BasicWaves)"]],["p-4467e4dd492dcd63.html","source-block-428","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/01 BasicWaves",["Sym (BasicWaves)","Source"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-215","BASS Oscillator (Bass)",[]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-242","Oscillator model 14 of 22 on the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type, shown on the display as Bass.",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-348","Parameters",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-365","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS/Saturate",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)","Parameters"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-465","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS/Fold",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)","Parameters"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-563","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS/Noise",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)","Parameters"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-661","Source",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)"]],["p-6f25377b1f0bb77c.html","source-block-674","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/14 BASS",["BASS Oscillator (Bass)","Source"]],["p-0f7cbe7eee767a9e.html","source-block-117","Fold (Bass)",[]],["p-0f7cbe7eee767a9e.html","source-block-133","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS.",["Fold (Bass)"]],["p-0f7cbe7eee767a9e.html","source-block-263","Applies a two-stage asymmetric fold that adds harmonics by folding parts of the wave that fall outside set boundaries back onto the wave. Don Buchla pioneered wavefolding in the early 1970s.",["Fold (Bass)"]],["p-0f7cbe7eee767a9e.html","source-block-457","Source",["Fold (Bass)"]],["p-0f7cbe7eee767a9e.html","source-block-470","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/14 BASS",["Fold (Bass)","Source"]],["p-2ae470e1aea9de35.html","source-block-117","Noise (Bass)",[]],["p-2ae470e1aea9de35.html","source-block-134","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS.",["Noise (Bass)"]],["p-2ae470e1aea9de35.html","source-block-263","Sets the noise level. Noise phase-modulates the two oscillators in opposite phases and is added between the fold stages.",["Noise (Bass)"]],["p-2ae470e1aea9de35.html","source-block-387","Source",["Noise (Bass)"]],["p-2ae470e1aea9de35.html","source-block-400","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/14 BASS",["Noise (Bass)","Source"]],["p-d1018ed113ac82c8.html","source-block-117","Saturate (Bass)",[]],["p-d1018ed113ac82c8.html","source-block-137","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/BASS.",["Saturate (Bass)"]],["p-d1018ed113ac82c8.html","source-block-265","Sets the saturation of the Cosine oscillator.",["Saturate (Bass)"]],["p-d1018ed113ac82c8.html","source-block-314","Source",["Saturate (Bass)"]],["p-d1018ed113ac82c8.html","source-block-327","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/14 BASS",["Saturate (Bass)","Source"]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-219","Chords (Chords)",[]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-239","Oscillator model 10 of 22 on the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type, shown on the display as Chords.",["Chords (Chords)"]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-347","Parameters",["Chords (Chords)"]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-364","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Chords/Type",["Chords (Chords)","Parameters"]],["p-c2395f6bc15a3d58.html","source-block-462","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Chords/Inv Transp",["Chords (Chords)","Parameters"]]],"format_version":2}